WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.508 --> 00:00:21.770
Luckily the princess had also told the children how to make her reappear.

2
00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:27.693
"If we close our eyes," said Gerald, "she'll reappear when we count to fifty.

3
00:00:28.373 --> 00:00:38.006
One, two, three, four Gerald and Kathleen closed their eyes, but Jimmy kept his open.

4
00:00:39.126 --> 00:00:42.508
Soon he saw a panel under the window slowly open.

5
00:00:42.528 --> 00:00:48.190
"I knew it was a trick," he thought before he closed his eyes.

6
00:00:51.811 --> 00:00:53.992
At fifty the children opened their eyes.

7
00:00:54.832 --> 00:00:56.533
But there was still no princess.

8
00:00:56.553 --> 00:01:01.255
"I think there's a secret cupboard under the window," said Jimmy.

9
00:01:01.275 --> 00:01:03.556
"Maybe she's hiding in it."

10
00:01:04.832 --> 00:01:05.593
"You looked!

11
00:01:05.893 --> 00:01:06.813
That's cheating!"

12
00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:08.755
said the voice of the princess.

13
00:01:09.735 --> 00:01:12.477
The voice was so close to Jimmy's ear that he jumped.

14
00:01:13.398 --> 00:01:15.299
But the princess was still invisible.

15
00:01:15.319 --> 00:01:17.761
"Where is she?"

16
00:01:18.261 --> 00:01:20.022
cried all three children at once.

17
00:01:21.083 --> 00:01:23.385
"Should we close our eyes and count again?"

18
00:01:23.805 --> 00:01:24.625
asked Kathleen.

19
00:01:24.645 --> 00:01:26.807
"Don't be silly!"

20
00:01:27.207 --> 00:01:28.688
The princess sounded angry.

21
00:01:28.708 --> 00:01:32.090
"We're not silly," said Jimmy.

22
00:01:32.110 --> 00:01:34.252
"We know you're hiding."

23
00:01:34.668 --> 00:01:37.490
"You think you're so clever pretending not to see me."

24
00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:39.231
The princess sounded hurt.

25
00:01:39.251 --> 00:01:42.113
"All right, I'll play your game."

26
00:01:42.133 --> 00:01:45.035
"But we can't see you," said Gerald.

27
00:01:45.055 --> 00:01:48.898
"Really?" The princess sounded afraid now.

28
00:01:48.918 --> 00:01:51.980
"We told you that," said Jimmy.

29
00:01:52.881 --> 00:01:55.023
He suddenly leaned backward and forward.

30
00:01:55.923 --> 00:01:57.004
Then it happened again.

31
00:01:57.024 --> 00:01:58.845
"What's wrong?"

32
00:01:59.286 --> 00:02:00.106
asked Kathleen.

33
00:02:00.126 --> 00:02:02.348
"She shook me!"

34
00:02:03.596 --> 00:02:06.398
"And I'll shake him again if he says he can't see me."

35
00:02:06.418 --> 00:02:09.279
"What are you so grumpy about?"

36
00:02:09.779 --> 00:02:11.020
Gerald was quite calm.

37
00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:14.042
"You said you'd be invisible and you are."

38
00:02:14.062 --> 00:02:16.083
"I'm not.

39
00:02:16.463 --> 00:02:18.344
You're just pretending not to see me."

40
00:02:18.364 --> 00:02:23.567
"On my word of honor, you're still invisible," said Gerald.

41
00:02:25.948 --> 00:02:26.889
There was silence.

42
00:02:28.289 --> 00:02:30.891
Then the princess said, "Come, I'll let you out.

43
00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:32.652
I'm tired of playing with you."

44
00:02:35.489 --> 00:02:37.690
They followed her voice out of the treasure room.

45
00:02:39.371 --> 00:02:41.032
She led them through some other rooms.

46
00:02:44.114 --> 00:02:45.595
One room was lined with mirrors.

47
00:02:47.075 --> 00:02:50.517
Gerald suddenly said to the princess, "Give me your hand."

48
00:02:50.998 --> 00:02:52.518
He pulled her in front of a mirror.

49
00:02:52.538 --> 00:02:55.520
"Now look for yourself."

50
00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:59.242
"Oh!" cried the princess in despair.

51
00:02:59.262 --> 00:03:01.323
"I am invisible.

52
00:03:01.743 --> 00:03:02.544
What shall I do?"

53
00:03:03.704 --> 00:03:05.986
"Take the ring off," said Kathleen.

54
00:03:06.006 --> 00:03:08.528
"It won't come off!

55
00:03:09.049 --> 00:03:10.230
But it can't be the ring.

56
00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:12.031
Rings don't make you invisible."

57
00:03:12.051 --> 00:03:15.954
"You said this one did," said Kathleen.

58
00:03:15.974 --> 00:03:18.697
"I was only playing at magic.

59
00:03:19.157 --> 00:03:20.938
I just hid in the secret cupboard."

60
00:03:20.958 --> 00:03:24.782
"But you can do magic," said Gerald.

61
00:03:24.802 --> 00:03:27.264
"What about the jewels?"

62
00:03:28.684 --> 00:03:32.065
"That's only a secret button that makes the panels open.

63
00:03:32.746 --> 00:03:34.006
What shall I do?"

64
00:03:34.647 --> 00:03:36.067
The princess was crying.

65
00:03:37.007 --> 00:03:41.289
Kathleen moved toward the voice and wrapped her arms around the invisible princess.

66
00:03:41.309 --> 00:03:43.970
"I'll tell the king and queen."

67
00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:53.014
"But they were only a game like "The bread and cheese," Jimmy said triumphantly.

68
00:03:53.034 --> 00:03:57.156
"And the story I told you in the maze.

69
00:03:57.832 --> 00:04:00.713
I wasn't really asleep for a hundred years."

70
00:04:02.313 --> 00:04:03.474
The princess sniffed.

71
00:04:03.494 --> 00:04:07.995
"But if you're not the princess, who are you?"

72
00:04:08.535 --> 00:04:09.355
said Kathleen.

73
00:04:09.375 --> 00:04:11.596
"My aunt works here.

74
00:04:12.136 --> 00:04:13.857
She'll be angry if she finds you.

75
00:04:14.377 --> 00:04:16.197
Run outside to the Temple of Flora.

76
00:04:16.577 --> 00:04:19.138
I'll meet you there after I close up the treasure room."

77
00:04:20.518 --> 00:04:23.039
The three children went to the Temple of Flora.

78
00:04:23.859 --> 00:04:25.680
It was cool and restful inside.

79
00:04:26.736 --> 00:04:29.857
Soon they heard footsteps and saw a shadow on the ground.

80
00:04:29.877 --> 00:04:35.719
"The door to the treasure room has blown shut," said the princess.

81
00:04:35.739 --> 00:04:38.700
"It's locked and the key's inside!"

82
00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:44.042
"Sit down and we'll talk about what to do," said Gerald.

83
00:04:44.062 --> 00:04:46.583
"But first tell us your name."

84
00:04:46.603 --> 00:04:54.634
"My my name is Mabel Prowse."

85
00:04:55.154 --> 00:04:57.815
The princess' voice was broken with sobs.

86
00:04:57.835 --> 00:05:03.937
"And and I'm the housekeeper's niece at the castle!"
